      "message": "There is a state associated with these files which ties 1st `ensureMicrodroidBootsSuccessfully` to second. The files written by first function call are used on the second function call. So inline with that, I think it is good to have the method take the 2 params.\n\nIt just happens that `prepareVirtualizationTestSetup` before tests removes  INSTANCE_ID_FILE, INSTANCE_IMG \u0026 they are recreated on st method call \u0026 re-used on second method.\n\nI think the ideal way to deal with this would be:\n\n```\ninstance_file \u003d FileUtil.createTempFile(..);\ninstance_id \u003d FileUtil.createTempFile(..);\nensureMicrodroidBootsSuccessfully(instance_file, instance_file)\nupgrade package\nensureMicrodroidBootsSuccessfully(instance_file, instance_file)\n```\n\nBut the current setup achieves that.",
